LOADKEYS(1)                 User Commands                LOADKEYS(1)

NAME
    loadkeys - set the keyboard layout of the console

SYNOPSIS
    loadkeys name
    loadkeys -c

DESCRIPTION
    loadkeys sets the layout of the console keyboard from the file
    /usr/share/keymaps/name.mkm. The layouts are us, fr, es, ru and jp.
    The graphical session takes its layout from the keymap setting.

OPTIONS
    -c   use the keymap setting of the desktop configuration

EXAMPLES
    loadkeys fr
    loadkeys -c

SEE ALSO
    init.conf(5), index(7)
